## Enforcement

**CI/CD check (future):**
```bash
# Run validation on all layers before allowing merge
python3 scripts/validate_all_layers.py
```

**Manual check (current):**
```bash
# Before git push, verify validation
python3 mods/<name>/scripts/validate_layer.py --layer builder/<pack>/layers/disc1.layer.json
```

**Commit message must include:**
```
Validation: PASSED
- Record count: 195 (180-220)
- Layer size: 22.3 MB (20-25 MB)
- Field decompression: LOST2, BLACKBGB, BLACKBGE, BLACKBG3 OK
- Checksums: Match v0.1.2 reference
```
